{
  "id": "welcome-festa-pulverizing-pancake-battle",
  "name": "Welcome Festa Pulverizing Pancake Battle",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The Pulverizing Pancake Battle was a pairs tournament at the Welcome Festa, held at Sunshine City in Tokyo on 14 January 2017. Only the top three pairs won a trophy, a holo Rare Candy in an acrylic case with their place printed on the card: Champion, 2nd Place or 3rd Place. Every win in its card or video game segment, up to four, earned a numbered holofoil Rare Candy, 025/SM-P, with the Pokémon Sun and Moon logos and a serial code for a Rare Candy in the games; 025/SM-P was given again at the Pulverizing Pancake Battle 2 on the second day of Champions League 2017 Osaka and Sendai."
  },
